+## Revision 2026-07-17 v3.1 — claim pools, proxied-server parity and Dolt compatibility
+
+This revision extends the post-v1.1 contract with four additional changes verified on Beads `main`. They remain **unreleased** relative to the stable v1.1.0 baseline unless the installed binary or an explicitly pinned build proves them.
