+1. **Pool-aware claim** (`849c05b`). Aliases listed in `claim.pools` may be preassigned by a dispatcher and taken through the normal atomic `--claim` path. Real assignees and unconfigured aliases retain anti-steal protection. A pool take carries the normal worker lease; after expiry, `bd reclaim` returns the issue to the unassigned pool rather than restoring the original alias.
